 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Kirisaki Karin wa Korosasenai"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "切崎花梨は殺させない"
   },
   {
    "zh": "切崎花梨不愿杀戮"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Hanashi Kirisaki was raised to be an assassin by an assassination organization. One day, on an undertaking, she attempted to kill a female manga artist. As usual, she was just trying to get the job done in a professional manner, her world changes drastically when she reads Tokimero, a manga serialized in the target magazine! She develops a strong yearning for the heartwarming adolescent school life! Hanashi immediately quits her job as a hitman, and for the first time, enjoys a normal student life, but an assassin is sent to her by the organization.",
   "ja": "暗殺組織によって殺し屋になるべく育てられた切崎花梨は、ある日、請け負った任務で女性漫画家の命を狙った。いつものようにプロとして仕事を済ませようとした折、ターゲットの連載漫画「ときメロ」を読んで、世界は一変！ほのぼの青春学園生活に強烈な憧れを抱いてしまう！！即行で殺し屋を辞め、初めて普通の学生ライフを満喫する花梨だったが、組織から刺客が送り込まれ――。青春はいつだって殺し、殺され、命がけ!?"
  },
